*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Epson TM-C3500 PPD for the tmc3500 Linux driver (rastertotmc3500).
*% Option keywords and values are parsed by tmc3500-core::options; keep them in sync
*% (tested by crates/rastertotmc3500/tests/ppd.rs).
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "0.1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "TMC3500.PPD"
*Product: "(TM-C3500)"
*Manufacturer: "Epson"
*ModelName: "Epson TM-C3500"
*ShortNickName: "Epson TM-C3500"
*NickName: "Epson TM-C3500 (tmc3500)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.2
*cupsModelNumber: 0
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-raster application/vnd.cups-raw 100 rastertotmc3500"
*DefaultResolution: 360dpi
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*MaxMediaWidth: "306"
*MaxMediaHeight: "3168"
*VariablePaperSize: True

*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Label108x174.8mm
*PageSize Label108x174.8mm/108 x 174.8 mm Die-cut Label: "<</PageSize[306.1 495.5]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Label108x174.8mm
*PageRegion Label108x174.8mm/108 x 174.8 mm Die-cut Label: "<</PageSize[306.1 495.5]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Label108x174.8mm
*ImageableArea Label108x174.8mm: "5.55 0 300.55 495.5"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Label108x174.8mm
*PaperDimension Label108x174.8mm: "306.1 495.5"

*% Custom sizes: width 1.00-4.25 in (labels; paper forms from 1.18 in), length 0.31-44 in.
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 72 306
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 22.32 3168
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*OpenUI *Collate/Collate: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *Collate
*DefaultCollate: False
*Collate True/Yes: ""
*Collate False/No: ""
*CloseUI: *Collate

*OpenUI *TmQuality/Print Quality: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *TmQuality
*DefaultTmQuality: Speed
*TmQuality Speed/Speed (360x360 dpi): "<</HWResolution[360 360]/cupsColorSpace 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*TmQuality Quality1/Quality Mode 1 (720x360 dpi): "<</HWResolution[720 360]/cupsColorSpace 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*TmQuality Quality2/Quality Mode 2 (720x360 dpi): "<</HWResolution[720 360]/cupsColorSpace 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsCompression 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *TmQuality

*OpenUI *TmMediaForm/Media Form: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *TmMediaForm
*DefaultTmMediaForm: DieCutGap
*TmMediaForm DieCutGap/Die-cut Label (Gap): ""
*TmMediaForm DieCutBlackMark/Die-cut Label (Black Mark): ""
*TmMediaForm ContinuousLabel/Continuous Label: ""
*TmMediaForm ContinuousPaper/Continuous Paper: ""
*TmMediaForm ContinuousPaperBlackMark/Continuous Paper (Black Mark): ""
*CloseUI: *TmMediaForm

*OpenUI *TmCoating/Media Coating: PickOne
